        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LE56lxmc1Z3E9hd_8ZVf-40" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="1:" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="80" x="134" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LE56lxmc1Z3E9hd_8ZVf-41" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Warehouse&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="460" x="234" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LE56lxmc1Z3E9hd_8ZVf-44" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cement Production System&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="600" x="114" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LE56lxmc1Z3E9hd_8ZVf-45" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Production of cement from nothing to mass storage&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Steps&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Stone is produced in &lt;i&gt;Large Stone Mines&lt;/i&gt; (&lt;i&gt;LSM&lt;/i&gt;) 1 and 2&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;When each is full (25), their contents are being sent to their respective &lt;i&gt;Sand Plants&lt;/i&gt; (&lt;i&gt;SP&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Note that &lt;i&gt;SPs&lt;/i&gt; only have an I/O capacity of 20, which means there will be 5 stone left in the &lt;i&gt;LSMs&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;When each SP is full (20), their contents are being sent to &lt;i&gt;Small Warehouse&lt;/i&gt; 1&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Note that&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Small Warehouses&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;have a storage capacity of 25, which means the last&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;SP&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;to send its contents will be left with 15 sand&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;At the same time,&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Large Ore Mine&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;LSM&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;3 already sent their contents to the &lt;i&gt;Cement Factory&lt;/i&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Small Warehouse&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;1 does so whenever it&#39;s full&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;When the Cement Factory is full, it sends its contents to&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Small Warehouse&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;2 to make space for next production cycle immediately&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Small Warehouse&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;2 Sends its content to the further &lt;i&gt;Large Modern Warehouse&lt;/i&gt; where cement produced across all production systems is centralized&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="310" width="600" x="114" y="660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LE56lxmc1Z3E9hd_8ZVf-46" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="froelen" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="94" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LE56lxmc1Z3E9hd_8ZVf-47" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="2026-09-15" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="70" x="664" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
